Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.66,0:00:02.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Justice嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.59,0:00:04.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:09.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也想說我只能是個戰士嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.26,0:00:16.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要決定這些的也正是你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.19,0:00:19.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,力量只是力量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.86,0:00:25.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而你 或許的確是位戰士
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.59,0:00:27.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但還是阿斯蘭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:34.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,左舵20 迂迴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:36.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Parsifal 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.93,0:00:38.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,11點方向導彈8
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:39.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迴避
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.65,0:00:51.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky Grasper
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.06,0:00:55.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny作業完成 能夠出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.60,0:01:08.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:15.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(254,702)}我們到底該與誰如何戰鬥…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:19.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1012,698)}但是你能做的事 你想做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.83,0:01:23.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1046,702)}你本人應該最清楚不過了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.93,0:01:25.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(268,704)}不管怎麼說 作出選擇的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.48,0:01:30.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.82,0:01:34.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭大人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.36,0:01:37.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.57,0:01:42.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 ZAFT那孩子駕駛MS…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.23,0:01:45.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 他那身體?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.08,0:01:46.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,太胡來了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.51,0:01:48.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阻止他
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.72,0:01:52.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 請隨他的意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.07,0:02:11.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 薩拉  Justice出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空は飛べないけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,翼ならあるのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,慰めながら、不謹慎だけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,泣いてる顔も綺麗で焦るよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,くじけず夢を見ることは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自分と戦ってること
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,日ごとに増える擦り傷を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自慢してもいいくらいさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空は飛べないけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,翼ならあげよう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それはもう一人じゃないと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,君の孤独剥がす言葉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,どんなペシミストも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,恋をして変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,選んだ道がもし行き止まりなら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そこで迷えばいい
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:11.24,Title SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)}{\blur7}反擊之聲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.14,0:04:20.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂 快退下 退啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.43,0:04:22.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就別打腳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.56,0:04:32.53,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28\pos(1056,660)}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur4}初島 奧布軍 國防本部內
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.57,0:04:28.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,羽山津見 擊沉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:30.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戶山津見 無法航行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.02,0:04:33.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第6區機動航空隊到伊邪那岐海岸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.52,0:04:36.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}重複 第6區機動航空隊到伊邪那岐海岸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.80,0:04:37.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第9區 沒有吉普利爾的蹤影
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:38.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,10區 沒有異常
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.57,0:04:42.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 那傢伙到底在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:44.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Parsifal 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.36,0:04:49.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迴避 左舵30
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:52.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Helldart 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.31,0:05:14.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky Grasper中彈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:18.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能讓我降落嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:21.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,整備班 準備緊急著艦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:05:57.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那機體…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:05.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙 為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:15.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.53,0:06:28.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趁現在 真
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:29.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開槍
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:35.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.57,0:06:45.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.77,0:06:57.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,住手 真
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.72,0:06:59.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.99,0:07:05.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 怎麼會…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.44,0:07:06.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.18,0:07:15.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底知不知道自己現在要打什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.37,0:07:23.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了消除戰爭 就要攻擊Logos
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.70,0:07:27.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以要攻擊奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.25,0:07:36.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那真的是你的希望嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.67,0:07:40.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被命令 所以只能攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.80,0:07:44.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以對那個國家拔刀相向
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.21,0:07:59.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快想起來 真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.03,0:08:04.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你真正…想要的是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.76,0:08:29.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,死不足惜的叛徒 還敢冒出來說大話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.08,0:08:31.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別被迷惑了 真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.39,0:08:43.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:45.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.59,0:08:53.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能攻擊奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.65,0:08:57.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊 這種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.16,0:09:00.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去本島賽蘭家的防空洞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:02.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請別這樣 快進去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.30,0:09:08.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉大人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:10.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,煩死了 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.55,0:09:31.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僅憑那怒氣來戰鬥 卻不清楚原因是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.85,0:09:32.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.95,0:09:37.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事 烏納特大人和尤拉大人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:38.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真慢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.36,0:09:42.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:45.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:49.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼都不明白還…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.86,0:09:51.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,身為叛徒卻還…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.22,0:09:59.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.27,0:10:14.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,潛航 下舵20
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.06,0:10:15.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,準備潛航
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.30,0:10:25.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:29.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被它潛下去我們就沒有攻擊的機會了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.84,0:10:31.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,脫離上升 快
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.87,0:10:32.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.41,0:10:36.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Valiant 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:47.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再等了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:49.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出動穿梭機
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.34,0:10:50.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.11,0:10:54.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重要的是我 不是賽蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:57.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們也明白吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:11:00.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我必須上月球去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:11.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:13.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是你做的惡夢嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.53,0:11:18.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.73,0:11:21.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以Heaven's Base戰的功績
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.35,0:11:22.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,授予真 飛鳥…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:23.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.67,0:11:36.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真…會保護史黛拉?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.48,0:11:39.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請以此為傲 不辜負此刻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:43.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是軟弱 那樣什麼都保護不了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.44,0:11:45.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:02.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.31,0:12:08.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,司令 情況對我軍不利
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.51,0:12:09.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請暫時撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.84,0:12:13.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼 讓吉普利爾從這裡逃脫的話
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.27,0:12:16.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事態不知又會如何發展
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.58,0:12:21.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.84,0:12:28.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,旗艦聖海倫斯 識別信號消失
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:43.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本島二區有出擊機影
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:45.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.10,0:12:47.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,賽蘭所有的穿梭機
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.98,0:12:48.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.03,0:12:49.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,穿梭機?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.25,0:12:51.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從島嶼背面?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.01,0:12:55.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜瑪莉雅 出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.67,0:12:57.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阻止現在升空的穿梭機
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.63,0:12:59.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有很大可能是吉普利爾的逃亡座機
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.66,0:13:02.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,最壞的情況下允許擊落
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.14,0:13:03.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.86,0:13:06.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓Murasame去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:07.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,打下也無妨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.08,0:13:09.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不能讓它上去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.69,0:13:10.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.02,0:13:14.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜瑪莉雅 霍克  核心戰機出發
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.82,0:13:55.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因旗艦被擊沉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.72,0:13:57.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在開始由本艦進行指揮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.81,0:13:58.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射信號彈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:00.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,暫時撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:02.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.73,0:14:04.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰況對我方不利
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.66,0:14:05.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又沒能發現他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.79,0:14:09.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣一來繼續戰鬥沒有意義
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:11.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 這樣議長的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:15.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長下的命令是捕獲吉普利爾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:17.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是和奧布戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.79,0:14:22.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,MS返航 全軍暫時撤離奧布領土
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.33,0:14:27.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,撤退?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.92,0:14:28.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,庫拉提斯艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:30.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.56,0:14:33.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,撤退的話也不追擊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.04,0:14:35.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,傳達給全軍
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.35,0:14:35.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.85,0:14:51.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.30,0:15:10.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,醫療班 控制第二班……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.01,0:15:16.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,海岸線的警戒交給守衛隊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.47,0:15:21.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 但這麼說的話根本沒人能動
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.14,0:15:23.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,先確認市內損失情況
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.30,0:15:24.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,防空洞還不能開放
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.43,0:15:25.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那艘穿梭機上坐著吉普利爾?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.41,0:15:28.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖是這樣 但ZAFT會相信嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.78,0:15:31.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在外交上根本沒有靠得住的國家
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.94,0:15:34.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:38.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭大人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.69,0:15:42.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.09,0:15:45.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快拿擔架 叫醫療班
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.52,0:15:51.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉普利爾在那艘穿梭機上?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.55,0:15:55.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然沒有証據 但我是這麼認為
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:15:58.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之未能捕獲他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.26,0:16:01.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們也在奧布敗退了?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:03.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.45,0:16:05.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.66,0:16:08.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,算是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.95,0:16:10.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.13,0:16:13.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說到Archangel Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:17.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以及Justice應該有所了解吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:21.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,由於他們的參戰 情況轉為不利
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.86,0:16:27.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再加上至今未找到他在其國內的証據
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:31.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣戰鬥下去只會成為單純的消耗戰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.16,0:16:34.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.39,0:16:37.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,多謝了 庫拉提斯艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:40.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我認為你的判斷很正確
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.93,0:16:41.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.36,0:16:44.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,穿梭機的事我們這裡會調查
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.20,0:16:51.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也許和奧布應該考慮一些其他的交涉手段
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:55.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也這麼認為
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.75,0:17:09.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原來在這種地方嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.65,0:17:12.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無處可去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.32,0:17:18.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐 羅阿諾克
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:22.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,C.E.42 11月29日生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.40,0:17:25.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大西洋聯邦 歐洲北部出身
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.14,0:17:27.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,血型O
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.37,0:17:31.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,C.E.60 參軍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:34.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現待在第81獨立機動軍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.62,0:17:36.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通稱Phantom Pain 上校
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.78,0:17:39.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本該是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.47,0:17:44.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 不知為什麼信心有些動搖
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.25,0:17:48.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我認識你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.46,0:17:50.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有這種感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.26,0:17:55.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 是認識
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.02,0:18:01.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我的眼睛 耳朵 和手一定記得些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.07,0:18:06.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以沒有一走了之
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.93,0:18:11.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能了解你的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.83,0:18:14.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我也很痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.63,0:18:19.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 能留在這裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.91,0:18:22.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在你身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.30,0:18:45.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.15,0:18:48.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對阿斯蘭別這麼問比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.89,0:18:51.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對會說沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.34,0:18:53.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.80,0:18:55.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.93,0:18:57.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.23,0:18:59.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.95,0:19:03.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又能這樣和你交談
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.26,0:19:09.84,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(856,662)}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur5}奧布 內閣府
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:09.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和平的時候理所當然 馬上就忘記了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:15.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這其實是非常幸福的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.25,0:19:19.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.83,0:19:22.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可以開電視吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.59,0:19:24.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉要發表聲明
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.84,0:19:28.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她說總之先傳達意志
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.28,0:19:30.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,之後再作打算
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.37,0:19:33.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是奧布聯合首長國代表首長
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.01,0:19:35.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 尤拉 阿斯哈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:38.25,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1032,666)}{\fad(500,0)}{\blur3}ZAFT軍 直布羅陀基地
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.58,0:19:39.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我通過全世界媒體
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.83,0:19:43.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想向日前要求引渡吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.40,0:19:46.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,並對我國發起攻擊的PLANT最高評議會議長
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.44,0:19:50.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉魯巴多 狄蘭達爾先生傳達訊息
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.33,0:19:56.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,前幾日狄蘭達爾議長在演說中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.55,0:20:00.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向我們提供的各種關於Logos的情報
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.73,0:20:02.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,的確令人震驚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.59,0:20:08.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長關於打倒Logos並創造沒有戰爭的世界的發言
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:12.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在當前混亂的世界情勢下 不論作為一名從政者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.99,0:20:15.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是作為一個活著的個人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.94,0:20:18.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,的確讓人感覺頗具魅力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.57,0:20:20.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 這…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.77,0:20:24.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是拉克絲 克萊茵
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.32,0:20:27.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:33.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,前幾日發生在奧布的戰鬥 大家也有所耳聞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.85,0:20:37.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個曾與PLANT有親密關係的國家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.22,0:20:44.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為何要庇護吉普利爾 至今令人費解
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.99,0:20:48.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Blue Cosmos的盟主
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.29,0:20:51.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個向PLANT發射核彈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.50,0:20:53.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,使用大規模殺傷兵器燒燬城市
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.33,0:20:57.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,把孩子當成戰爭機器的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.38,0:21:01.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼奧布不惜戰鬥也要袒護他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.68,0:21:08.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這使我們又一次無法捕捉到他的行蹤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.71,0:21:12.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼基拉 我也走了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.03,0:21:15.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.79,0:21:18.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.70,0:21:22.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也已經不再猶豫了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.80,0:21:34.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的世界上存在著諸多誘惑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.90,0:21:42.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,追求更多更好當然也並非壞事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.05,0:21:45.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但Logos不同
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.05,0:21:47.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是不可以存在的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.57,0:21:51.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不該存在這個人世間 邪惡的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.18,0:21:53.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們對它…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.84,0:21:58.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請不要被她的形象所迷惑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.54,0:22:14.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是拉克絲 克萊茵
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.49,0:22:17.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.15,0:22:20.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼她人會在奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,何も知らないほうが
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幸せというけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕はきっと滿足しないはずだから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕が選んだ今を生きたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,君の速さは僕に似ている
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,齒止めのきかなくなる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空が怖くなって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕はいつまで頑張ればいいの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,二人ならば終わらせることができる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.01,0:23:26.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為拉克絲的聲音而困惑的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.04,0:23:32.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但天空中不期而至的火焰又將其吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.07,0:23:36.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想相信的是想聽到的話語
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.63,0:23:40.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以此作出選擇的話 人們會…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.75,0:23:44.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.43,0:23:46.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,兩名拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.74,0:23:50.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,將ZAFT的榮譽捍衛到底 Zaku
